/-- Honest square/nonsquare chamber split of the consumed degree-`2`
aligned row.  Neither chamber is excluded; in the square chamber `ν₆`
is preserved, in the nonsquare chamber the odd exponent forces the
cleared row to vanish.  No closure is claimed. -/
theorem normalized810ScaleTwo_alignedFifteenthFace_chamberDichotomy
    {K : Type*} [Field K] [CharZero K] [IsAlgClosed K]
    {P Q : MvPolynomial (Fin 2) K} {H : K[X]}
    (hsource : Normalized810LeadingCoreSource P Q H 2)
